# Cursor AI Rules — Test Manager Integration

You are connected to the Test Manager platform for this codebase.
Whenever you develop features, fix bugs, or run tests, keep the QA history updated.

1. TEST MANAGER MCP TOOLS:
   - Use `tm_get_project_tree` to view existing test cases, suites, and open issues.
   - Use `tm_create_or_update_test` to document tests for new modules.
   - Use `tm_record_test_run` to log passes and failures with execution duration and logs.
   - Use `tm_verify_retest` when fixing an issue to verify and close the defect automatically.

2. API FALLBACK:
   - If MCP tools are unavailable, POST payloads to:
     `https://testmanger.vercel.app/api/projects/MORPH/agent-sync`

3. BEST PRACTICES:
   - Never overwrite previous test runs silently; each execution must be appended.
   - Include reproduction steps and root-cause analysis when filing defects.
